            VALUES (c_system_instance_id, c_system_instance_id, v_thread_id, now() + (0 * interval '1 minute'), 'Plot is designed around a simple workflow that keeps your focus where you choose while knowing what''s happening.

New and updated threads arrive at the top of **Active**. _When a thread…_

- _… is just FYI_: Simply read it and it''ll move to **Done**.
- _… needs follow-up or careful reading_: Mark it **To do** to keep it in **Active**.
- _… deserves attention later_: Mark it **Do later** to move it out of **Active** until a future day.
- _… belongs in another focus_: **Move** it. Plot learns and moves similar threads there in the future.
- _… never needs attention_: **Mute** it. You can always find threads in Done or with search, but muted threads (and similar ones) will skip **Active**.

Instead of interruptions fragmenting your day, you can trust that everything gets done at the best time.', 'building-blocks');
    ELSE
        UPDATE public.note SET content = 'Plot is designed around a simple workflow that keeps your focus where you choose while knowing what''s happening.

New and updated threads arrive at the top of **Active**. _When a thread…_

- _… is just FYI_: Simply read it and it''ll move to **Done**.
